				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "ZjeOsD2ZDQCcs7yADqn2mw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "In this bonus chapter, we are going to learn how to visualize code using just the AST. While you cannot expect the highest level of semantic insight from analyses that purely focus on the AST, it can be a fun and interesting challenge, and give you some ideas on how to work with ASTs."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-04-17T21:59:36.075691+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:45:39.487355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "yZ0R0UCZDQCJmVqTBAU6hQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "When I first got the Carp parser working, for instance, I asked myself the question “How are the files in the standard library interconnected?” Using nothing but the parser, I was able to answer that question within minutes."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-04-17T22:12:07.557482+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:45:39.487355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "32aj/kCZDQCJp1bbBAU6hQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "First, we parse all the files from the standard library and collect their `load` statements. From that, we build a mapping from files to the files they load."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:49:16.267433+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:49:16.267433+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "QhJBBYNqRgO1NvYUIRYw+w=="
				},
				"code" : "core := CarpServerClient coreDirectory asFileReference.\rloads := Dictionary new.\r(core filesMatching: '*.carp') do: [ :file |\r\t| ast |\r\tast := CarpParser parse: file contents.\r\tloads\r\t\tat: file basename\r\t\tput: (((ast allNodesOfType: CarpListNode)\r\t\t\tselect: [ :list |\r\t\t\t\tlist expressions size = 2\r\t\t\t\t\tand: [ (list expressions first isKindOf: CarpVariableNode)\r\t\t\t\t\tand: [ list expressions first value source beginsWith: 'load' ] ] ])\r\t\t\tcollect: [ :list | list expressions second value source trimBoth: [ :c | c = $\" ] ]) ].\rloads"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-04-17T22:13:49.336046+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-04-17T22:14:51.084501+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "lh+yBEGZDQCJqXdGBAU6hQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "From there, it is just a matter of visualizing the data. {{gtClass:GtMondrian}} is a powerful visualization tool for such questions, and fairly quick to use."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-04-17T22:14:58.363273+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:45:39.487355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "t5/kCEGZDQCJsYevBAU6hQ=="
				},
				"code" : "\"the mapping from above\"\raDict := loads.\r\r\"the actual view\"\rview := GtMondrian new. \rview nodes\r\tstencil: [:each |\r\t\tBlElement new\r\t\t\tsize: 5@5;\r\t\t\tgeometry: BlCircleGeometry new;\r\t\t\tbackground: Color gray ];\r\twith: aDict keys.\rview edges connectToAll: [:each | aDict at: each ]. \rview layout force. \rview"
			},
